Package: jglance
Type: Package
Title: Glance at jamovi Data
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Ravi Selker
Maintainer: Ravi Selker <selker.ravi@gmail.com>
Description: A jamovi module that gives a quick visual overview of an
    entire dataset. Renders an interactive variable list with sparklines,
    auto-detected data-quality notes, and per-variable detail panels.
    Built on the besoplots technique (UMD bundle injected via an Html
    results item).
License: AGPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: jmvcore, R6, jsonlite
